    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small quick game about building a factory to launch planets into a solar system! Grow your base and increase production to make the ultimate factory for launching planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your factory making skills to <strong><u>build a factory</u></strong> to produce planets and launch them into a solar system, doing so will allow you to produce goods faster and unlock more planets to produce and launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your solar system is done, activate <strong><u>supernova</u></strong> to upgrade your sun into a <strong><u>black hole</u></strong>, you then can start producing and launching stars into a <strong><u>galaxy</u></strong> around a black hole!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small quick game about building a factory to launch planets into a solar system! Grow your base and increase production to make the ultimate factory for launching planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your factory making skills to <strong><u>build a factory</u></strong> to produce planets and launch them into a solar system, doing so will allow you to produce goods faster and unlock more planets to produce and launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your solar system is done, activate <strong><u>supernova</u></strong> to upgrade your sun into a <strong><u>black hole</u></strong>, you then can start producing and launching stars into a <strong><u>galaxy</u></strong> around a black hole!</p>",
